            "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Create a finished high-quality unique CLEAN BACKGROUND PLATE for portrait4:5 jigsaw puzzle illustration \"A ferry deck with wooden seats and life rings\". Premium cozy travel-game storybook digital painting matching approved Art Direction V2 gameplay art: tactile subtly brushed surfaces, fine hand-painted detail, believable dimensional objects, gentle upper-left sunlight, rich color separation and small discoveries. NOT flat vector, NOT photorealistic, NOT generic procedural art. A quiet ferry deck with large warm terracotta/rust painted benches and rail panels, cream life rings and a rope coil. A little blue sea in distance, soft sky. No destination or ship branding. Terracotta surfaces dominate, not blue sea. Include potted nautical greenery and real hanging ropes. Viewpoint: wide intimate view from slightly above. The picture must fill the entire portrait4:5 canvas, ideal1280x1600; no borders, text, UI, grid, title, logo, watermark or transparent holes. This is a complete naturally composed environment with real stable anchors for five small moving details later added as separate alpha layers. Do not add floating decorative particles or overlay patterns. Preserve coherent scale and perspective. No famous destination landmark. Keep the requested main color visible throughout the scene, not only a tiny accent.",
