            "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. A production RGBA transparent sprite atlas of five unique painted details belonging to the scene \"A ferry deck with wooden seats and life rings\". Match a premium cozy illustrated puzzle: rich dimensional storybook digital painting, subtle brushed pigment, believable natural forms, fine detail, soft upper-left sun, coherent warm light and tactile materials. No flat vector, no photos, no generic geometric particles. EXACTLY five isolated objects, strict3 columns by2 rows, landscape3:2 canvas. Leave the sixth bottom-right cell perfectly empty transparent. TRUE alpha transparency, no matte, no background, no grid or cell borders, no frame, no shadow rectangle, no labels or text. Place each entire object inside the central50% of its own cell, leaving wide25% gutters on every side. FULL complete loops, stems, wings, wisps and thin strands must fit safely inside each cell; none may touch canvas or cell edges. Top row left to right: a feathery olive-green fern frond with a thin lower stalk; a small yellow seaside daisy sprig with two leaves and tapered bottom stem; a short curved section of natural beige hemp rope ending in a loose complete bow, top attachment clearly defined. Bottom row left to right: one small white and grey gull in three-quarter side view, wings partly spread in flight; a small rust-red fabric pennant on a short ivory top cord, no symbols; EMPTY. Preserve detailed painted alpha edges and translucent material where specified. Do not include containers, scenery or extra items. All five details are real meaningful parts of this specific scene, sharing its scale and light.",
